# Landing area for SharePoint payload exports, local inspection only.
#
# Everything here is ignored on purpose. These files carry personal data
# (workers, leave, CRA, Whoz profiles) and must never enter git history,
# where removing them needs a history rewrite rather than a delete.
#
# Only field paths, types and counts derived from these files belong in the
# repo, in the payload inventory under 2607-o2-requirements/.
*
!.gitignore
